  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to reduce FGM and Cutting in the three districts(), targeting 28,672 community members by 2027. The project is addressing the causes and effects of FGM and aims to empower community members and change attitudes towards the practice. The project focus is on 1) Building women, girls, men and boy&#x2019;s agency to champion and voice against Female Genital Mutilation/ Cutting; 2)Women and Girls economically empowered to prevent and fight the drivers of FGM/C and its effects; 3) Effectively Implementing existing formal and informal legal and policy framework on FGM/C and harmful practices against FGM/C</narrative>
  </description>
